# Detection-side claims: independent replication

Fresh seeds (910000+, disjoint from every earlier study). Storm 50% at t=1500, N=200, R=5, pure V3. 95% intervals are exact (Clopper-Pearson).

Environment: Python 3.14.8.

## A. Is a spread of detection speeds protective? (p = 0)

| network | runs losing data | rate | 95% CI |
|---|---|---|---|
| homogeneous dl=96 | 11/72 | 15% | 8–26% |
| homogeneous dl=192 | 25/72 | 35% | 24–47% |
| 50/50 mix dl=96 + dl=192 | 13/72 | 18% | 10–29% |

